 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Explicar la razón",
    "@en": "Explain the reason"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para justificar algo que has dicho, como «es que…», se usa **-거든(요)** después de una afirmación: 바빴거든요 = es que estaba ocupado. 피곤하거든요 = es que estoy cansado.",
     "@en": "To justify something you said, like «es que…», is used **-거든(요)** after a statement: 바빴거든요 = is that I was busy. 피곤하거든요 = I'm tired."
    },
    {
     "@es": "어제 안 갔어요. 시간이 없었거든요 = no fui ayer, es que no tenía tiempo.",
     "@en": "어제 안 갔어요. 시간이 없었거든요 = I didn't go yesterday, I just didn't have time."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "En la conversación",
    "@en": "In the conversation"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Es muy común en el habla para dar una razón de forma suave.",
     "@en": "It is very common in speech to give a reason in a soft way."
    },
    {
     "@es": "모르거든요 = es que no lo sé.",
     "@en": "모르거든요 = I don't know."
    }
   ]
